\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Post-training flat-sky $D_\ell ^{XY}$ comparison in $\mu \mathrm  {K}_{\rm  CMB}$-based map units (after de-standardisation), for $XY\in \{TT,EE,BB,TE\}$. Solid black: validation patches drawn from the saved $p(f)$ prior ($N_{\rm  ref}=3277$), which constitute the empirical reference distribution. Dashed coloured: $N_{\rm  gen}=64$ patches generated by the trained deterministic flow-matching model, sampled with the Heun second-order ODE integrator at $N_{\rm  steps}=1200$, $t\in [0,0.995]$, and a state-clipping bound $|\bm  {x}|\!\leq \!5$. Dotted grey: Monte Carlo theory band built from $8$ independent Gaussian full-sky realisations of the lensed CAMB spectra passed through the identical patch and flat-sky pipeline ($N_{\rm  theory}\!=\!512$ patches). The agreement between the validation and theory bands is a calibration check on the patch / flat-sky estimator pipeline itself; the agreement between the generated and validation bands is the direct test of the trained prior.}}{31}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:dl_panel_phys}{{1}{31}{Post-training flat-sky $D_\ell ^{XY}$ comparison in $\mu \mathrm {K}_{\rm CMB}$-based map units (after de-standardisation), for $XY\in \{TT,EE,BB,TE\}$. Solid black: validation patches drawn from the saved $p(f)$ prior ($N_{\rm ref}=3277$), which constitute the empirical reference distribution. Dashed coloured: $N_{\rm gen}=64$ patches generated by the trained deterministic flow-matching model, sampled with the Heun second-order ODE integrator at $N_{\rm steps}=1200$, $t\in [0,0.995]$, and a state-clipping bound $|\xvec |\!\leq \!5$. Dotted grey: Monte Carlo theory band built from $8$ independent Gaussian full-sky realisations of the lensed CAMB spectra passed through the identical patch and flat-sky pipeline ($N_{\rm theory}\!=\!512$ patches). The agreement between the validation and theory bands is a calibration check on the patch / flat-sky estimator pipeline itself; the agreement between the generated and validation bands is the direct test of the trained prior}{figure.1}{}}
